{
  "title": "【相談】夫が冷蔵庫の卵に一個ずつ名前を書いている",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:07:13 ID:7kQ2mP01</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">冷蔵庫を開けたら卵に「たかし」「ゆうこ」「部長」って書いてある。<br>夫の字。<br>どういうことなのか聞く前に相談させて。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:08:42 ID:7kQ2mP02</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">まず部長を救出しろ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:09:05 ID:7kQ2mP03</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">卵に役職つける家庭初めて見た</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:10:31 ID:7kQ2mP04</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res1\">&gt;&gt;1</a><br>たかしは誰よ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:12:02 ID:7kQ2mP05</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res4\">&gt;&gt;4</a><br>夫です。ゆうこは私。部長は夫の会社の部長だと思う。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:12:58 ID:7kQ2mP06</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長だけ他人なのに冷蔵庫で同居ｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:14:16 ID:7kQ2mP07</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">卵は何個あるの？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:15:47 ID:7kQ2mP08</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">六個入り。残りは「課長」「経理」「新人」。<br>全部会社関係だった。私は経理でも新人でもない。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:17:20 ID:7kQ2mP09</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">家庭内人事異動のお知らせ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:18:09 ID:7kQ2mP0a</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ゆうこだけ家族枠で浮いてる</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:20:33 ID:7kQ2mP0b</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">冷蔵庫の中で会議でもしてるのか</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:22:04 ID:7kQ2mP0c</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">夫は風呂に入ってる。<br>卵の配置が気になる。たかしとゆうこが離されてる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:23:38 ID:7kQ2mP0d</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">そこに夫婦の危機を見出すなｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:25:01 ID:7kQ2mP0e</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長はどの位置？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:26:44 ID:7kQ2mP0f</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">真ん中。<br>部長の両脇が課長と経理。<br>たかしが端。ゆうこは反対側の端。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:28:12 ID:7kQ2mP0g</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">人事配置としては妙にリアル</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:29:27 ID:7kQ2mP0h</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res15\">&gt;&gt;15</a><br>新人の居場所は</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:30:50 ID:7kQ2mP0i</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新人は手前。<br>いちばん取りやすい場所。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:32:03 ID:7kQ2mP0j</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新人から食われる職場</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:33:41 ID:7kQ2mP0k</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ブラックすぎるｗｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:35:06 ID:7kQ2mP0l</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">殻に直接油性ペン？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:36:29 ID:7kQ2mP0m</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res21\">&gt;&gt;21</a><br>鉛筆っぽい。薄い字。<br>しかも部長だけ二重丸がついてる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:38:15 ID:7kQ2mP0n</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長の評価高いな</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:39:52 ID:7kQ2mP0o</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">卵を持ち上げて裏も見てみて</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:41:09 ID:7kQ2mP0p</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長の裏に「金」って書いてあった。<br>怖くなって戻した。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:42:17 ID:7kQ2mP0q</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">金の卵ｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:44:03 ID:7kQ2mP0r</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">金曜日に食べる指定かもしれない</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:45:20 ID:7kQ2mP0s</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">木曜の夜に部長の裏を見る妻</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:47:06 ID:7kQ2mP0t</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">夫が風呂から出た。<br>聞いてみる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:49:11 ID:7kQ2mP0u</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">実況を待つ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:50:47 ID:7kQ2mP0v</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長の処遇が気になる</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:55:23 ID:7kQ2mP0w</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">聞いた。<br>夫「卵を割るときに誰を選ぶかで一日の気合いが違う」<br>だって。意味がわからない。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:56:31 ID:7kQ2mP0x</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">聞いても意味がわからなくて安心した</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:57:48 ID:7kQ2mP0y</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">部長を割ると気合いが入るのか</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 21:59:06 ID:7kQ2mP0z</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">夫いわく「嫌な仕事がある日は部長を食べて勝つ」。<br>金曜に部長を食べる予定らしい。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:00:42 ID:7kQ2mP10</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">金の謎だけ解けた</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:02:08 ID:7kQ2mP11</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">上司への反抗が朝食限定</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:03:35 ID:7kQ2mP12</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ゆうこは何のためにいるの？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:05:17 ID:7kQ2mP13</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res38\">&gt;&gt;38</a><br>聞いたら「ゆうこは最後まで取っておく」って。<br>ちょっと嬉しかった自分が嫌。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:06:49 ID:7kQ2mP14</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">食材として大事にされて喜ぶな</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:08:12 ID:7kQ2mP15</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">たかし本人はいつ食べるんだ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:09:34 ID:7kQ2mP16</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">たかしは月曜の朝に食べるそうです。<br>「自分に勝つ」らしい。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:10:58 ID:7kQ2mP17</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">自己啓発が卵六個で完結</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:12:26 ID:7kQ2mP18</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新人は？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:13:55 ID:7kQ2mP19</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新人は今日の朝食べる予定だったけど寝坊して残ったそう。<br>「新人にはまだチャンスがある」と言ってる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:15:09 ID:7kQ2mP1a</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">新人の評価だけ優しいｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:16:43 ID:7kQ2mP1b</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ところで賞味期限は？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:18:04 ID:7kQ2mP1c</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res47\">&gt;&gt;47</a><br>来週の火曜日。<br>夫の予定だと全部期限内。そこはちゃんとしてた。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:19:37 ID:7kQ2mP1d</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">人事管理より在庫管理が優秀</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res50\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">50：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:21:02 ID:7kQ2mP1e</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">ゆうこを最後に食べるってことは火曜？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res51\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">51：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:22:28 ID:7kQ2mP1f</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">火曜だって。<br>「週の前半を乗り切るための切り札」らしい。<br>もう私、卵焼き作っていいのかわからない。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res52\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">52：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:23:56 ID:7kQ2mP1g</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">卵焼き作るたびに部署が消滅する</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res53\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">53：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:25:11 ID:7kQ2mP1h</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">奥様も夫の弁当に名前書いてみたら</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res54\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">54：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:27:03 ID:7kQ2mP1i</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">面白そうだから、夫の明日の弁当箱に「社長」って書いた付箋を貼った。<br>夫が「社長はまだ早い」って真顔で剥がした。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res55\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">55：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:28:22 ID:7kQ2mP1j</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">昇進を断るなｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res56\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">56：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:29:46 ID:7kQ2mP1k</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">旦那さんの世界観が頑丈すぎる</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res57\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">57：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:31:15 ID:7kQ2mP1l</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\"><a href=\"#res1\">&gt;&gt;1</a><br>結局、何を相談したかったの？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res58\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">相談奥</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:33:04 ID:7kQ2mP1m</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">明日の朝、私が目玉焼きを作っていいかどうか。<br>夫は「部長だけは俺に割らせて」と言ってる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res59\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">59：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:34:27 ID:7kQ2mP1n</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">だったら最初から夫に聞けｗｗｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res60\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">60：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:35:39 ID:7kQ2mP1o</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">卵の名前より先に相談内容を書けｗ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res61\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">61：<span class=\"res_name\" style=\"color:#008000!important;font-weight:bold\">可愛い奥様</span> 2009/10/15(木) 22:37:08 ID:7kQ2mP1p</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;padding-left:1.2em\">全員で部長の心配して損したわｗｗｗ</div></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"fc2_footer\" style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;height:auto;\">\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n",
